    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mhayo go ng'wa Mulungu kū banhū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī kale ū Mulungu walūngalūngaga nabo a bakūlūgenji bise ng'hangala ningī mu nzīla ja mbika na mbika, kūbītīla mu bahangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū mu shikū ja kū būkalīkījo īji, walūngalūngile nise mu nzīla ya Ng'wana, ūyo antūūlile kūbiza ng'wingīji wa shikolo shose; nīyo ī shiseeng'wa shose pye akashibeeja mu nzīla yakwe ū ng'wenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wei alī kwaaka kw'ikūjo lya ng'wa Mulungu, na suso yakwe ūmo alī gete; hama pyī ī shikolo ashidimile na mhayo gwa būdūla bokwe. Aho wamala kūtūūla nzīla ya kweja shibi, wigasha kū nkono gwa būlyo; kwikūjo lya būsugi bo ng'wigūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū ng'wene ū ntaale kūkīla pye a bamalaika, nguno ū wei alī ng'wingīji wa lina itaale kūtinda lyabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'wana na bamalaika",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū gīsī ū Mulungu wabīta kūng'wīla malaika kī gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
